Note on data:

The Berlin datasets rendered by this software are published by third parties
(Berlin Senate, VBB, BVG, OpenStreetMap contributors, Geofabrik) under their
own licences — dl-de/by-2-0, dl-de/zero-2-0, CC-BY-4.0, and ODbL 1.0. Each
dataset is attributed in the product's Impressum and in the responses of the
data-serving API endpoints. This MIT licence covers the code in this
repository only, not the datasets it operates on.
